{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Apart</strong> is a short horror game where you run your own toy workshop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop, saw, paint, pack, and ship your toys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951290/extras/c50830b2d1d9be2fab4af28afc0146b6.poster.avif?t=1769130661\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951290/extras/c50830b2d1d9be2fab4af28afc0146b6.webm?t=1769130661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951290/extras/c50830b2d1d9be2fab4af28afc0146b6.mp4?t=1769130661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Mike, an old carpenter who has lost his entire family and is now completely alone. Toys are the last memories of his past life and his late wife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951290/extras/a976d90cf8b09ef7441ae308acd50174.poster.avif?t=1769130661\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951290/extras/a976d90cf8b09ef7441ae308acd50174.webm?t=1769130661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951290/extras/a976d90cf8b09ef7441ae308acd50174.mp4?t=1769130661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is to craft toys carefully for all your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951290/extras/cc96e10065cdfe3840dd15e663db2fba.poster.avif?t=1769130661\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951290/extras/cc96e10065cdfe3840dd15e663db2fba.webm?t=1769130661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951290/extras/cc96e10065cdfe3840dd15e663db2fba.mp4?t=1769130661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong> \u2013 consists of randomly generated orders and a variety of tools for crafting toys.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized graphics</strong> \u2013 the game uses a posterization post-processing effect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting system</strong> \u2013 includes chopping, sawing, painting wood, and packing toys.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3951290?t=1769130661","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951290/f993b6b11b55daa7cd8a5afd784c5d1274cb1d14/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769130661","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951290/afa82d46d54079d6ffcbe57341a6f57b840981b4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769130661","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951290/afa82d46d54079d6ffcbe57341a6f57b840981b4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769130661","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"May contain violence scenes for some categories of players